      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“The Most Unforgettable Day”",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "I don’t think I’ll ever forget my first trip abroad. I had never ever been on a plane before, and I was both terrified and thrilled. My parents had warned me that I might get lost or confused, but nothing could have prepared me for how different everything was. The food, the people, the language—it was all unlike anything I had ever known. Even now, years later, I sometimes wonder if I’ll ever feel that same sense of wonder again."
          }
